 "paras": [
  "The new Scout® Traveler™ and Terra™ models are here. Born from an American legend, retooled for a new era. Ready, willing and capable for the road ahead. Or far off it.1",
  "The original off-road icon. The one that united work with play. The one that made “sport utility” a household term. The one to combine a farm tool with a family hauler, and from which all others have followed since. The ",
  "Before 1961, International Harvester built tools that helped build, feed, and defend America. Then they shifted gears, producing sport utility vehicles that soon found a place in American driveways. The grit that defined",
  "Our roots run deep, but they don’t define us. We’re blending DNA from the SUV that started it all with the pulse of modern technology to create something unique, a true original just like the first Scouts. This is more t",
  "On October 24, 2024, Scout Motors introduced the next era of rugged trucks and SUVs on a sunlit hill in Franklin, Tennessee.",
  "This is a company as rugged as our vehicles. One that’s built to last, from the dirt up, by passionate people. American-born and American-built, Scout vehicles will be engineered in Detroit, built in South Carolina, and ",
